{
    "id":  26466,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "EcoLite Solar LED Floodlight 100W 3200Lm 3CCT | PIR Sensor + Remote Control | IP65",
    "reference":  "FLSS100W-3CCT-91561",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\nThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoLite 100W Solar LED Floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e delivers powerful and efficient outdoor lighting of up to \u003cstrong\u003e3200 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e thanks to its high-brightness SMD LEDs and \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT system (3000K / 4000K / 6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e. Ideal for gardens, patios, plots, terraces and outdoor areas, it features a \u003cstrong\u003ePIR motion sensor\u003c/strong\u003e with detection up to 3 metres and a \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e for easy configuration of different operating modes and energy saving. Equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003e12W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003e10,000 mAh 3.2V\u003c/strong\u003e lithium battery, it provides great autonomy with zero electricity consumption. Its \u003cstrong\u003edurable ABS\u003c/strong\u003e construction and \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 waterproof\u003c/strong\u003e protection guarantee maximum durability outdoors. An ecological, practical and easy-to-install solution for outdoor solar LED lighting.\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eEcoLite 100 3200Lm Solar LED Floodlight Selectable 3CCT (3000K / 4000K / 6500K)\u0026nbsp;| PIR Sensor + Remote Control | IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoLite 100W Solar LED Floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e is an efficient, modern and sustainable outdoor lighting solution, designed to deliver high performance with zero energy consumption. Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-brightness SMD\u003c/strong\u003e LEDs and \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT technology (3000K / 4000K / 6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e, it lets you choose between warm, neutral or cool light depending on the ambience and lighting needs. With up to \u003cstrong\u003e3200 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e, it is ideal for illuminating gardens, patios, terraces, entrances, plots, pathways and all kinds of outdoor areas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis solar LED floodlight features a practical \u003cstrong\u003ePIR motion sensor\u003c/strong\u003e with a detection range of up to \u003cstrong\u003e3 metres\u003c/strong\u003e, optimising energy savings and improving outdoor security. It also includes a \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e, making it easy to configure different operating modes, light intensity and energy-saving options quickly and conveniently.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThanks to its efficient \u003cstrong\u003e12W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e and rechargeable \u003cstrong\u003e10,000 mAh (3.2V)\u003c/strong\u003e lithium battery, the EcoLite 100W provides up to \u003cstrong\u003e12 hours of autonomy\u003c/strong\u003e without any electrical connection. Its solar-powered operation helps reduce electricity consumption and promotes more ecological and sustainable lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-resistance ABS\u003c/strong\u003e and featuring \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 waterproof and dustproof\u003c/strong\u003e protection, this solar LED floodlight is ready to withstand rain, humidity, dust and adverse weather conditions, guaranteeing maximum durability and outdoor performance all year round.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eEcoLite 100W\u003c/strong\u003e is perfect for use in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nGardens and patios\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nHome entrances and garages\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPlots and estates\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nPaths and walkways\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nTerraces and balconies\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nOutdoor security lighting\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nAreas without access to the electricity grid\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eA practical, efficient and easy-to-install option for those looking for a \u003cstrong\u003epowerful, durable and low-consumption outdoor solar LED floodlight\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
